      <title>OPT Laser Profile 3D Cameras</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-line-laser-cameras/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/opt-3d-line-laser-cameras/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;The laser profile camera family targets motion-assisted 3D measurement and inspection. The line is organized into LPE2, LPF2, and LPH2 series, with 21 model options, scan widths from 7 mm to 2600 mm, X-axis profile density up to 6400 points, and sampling up to 54 kHz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















