&lt;em&gt;Laser triangulation and profile extraction pipeline.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;product-strengths&#34;&gt;Product strengths&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The series emphasizes robust profile extraction, high frame rate, dense X-axis sampling, integrated operation without an external controller, and software pairing with Smart3. The algorithm stack includes HDR fusion, vibration correction, stray-light suppression, peak sensitivity tuning, preprocessing, height correction, and profile post-processing.&lt;/p&gt;
