&lt;h2 id=&#34;algorithms&#34;&gt;Algorithms&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The line-laser workflow combines subpixel center extraction, HDR fusion, noise filtering, peak sensitivity adjustment, vibration correction, and point-cloud post-processing. These are especially important for dark plastic, reflective metal, glue surfaces, and narrow weld structures where stripe returns are unstable.&lt;/p&gt;
