&lt;h2 id=&#34;applications&#34;&gt;Applications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Representative applications include battery weld dimension inspection, transparent glue volume calibration, dispensing path guidance, 3D defect inspection, step-height measurement, gap-width measurement, and full-coverage multi-camera inspection.&lt;/p&gt;
